  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "faaf6845-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 0,
      "content": "SDSU offers mirrored programs at SDSU Imperial Valley, located in Calexico, CA. These programs are available through Transfer Success Pathway (TSP), a new program offering guaranteed admission to eligible students. Due to high demand, admission to SDSU is highly competitive. General admission information is available at: http://arweb.sdsu.edu/es/admissions/transfers/index.html",
      "contentHtml": "<p>SDSU offers mirrored programs at SDSU Imperial Valley, located in Calexico, CA. These programs are available through&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.calstate.edu/apply/transfer/Pages/transfer-success-pathway.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Transfer Success Pathway</a>&nbsp;(TSP), a new program offering guaranteed admission to eligible students.</p><p> </p><p>Due to high demand, admission to SDSU is highly competitive. General admission information is available at:<a href=\"http://arweb.sdsu.edu/es/admissions/transfers/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://arweb.sdsu.edu/es/admissions/transfers/index.html</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbaf6845-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralTitle",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 1,
      "content": "GENERAL INFORMATION-DEGREE NOTES",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fcaf6845-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 2,
      "content": "The emphasis in education-generalist is open only to students who have completed the California Community College Associate in Arts in Elementary Teacher Education (AA-T) degree and completed the Transfer Model Curriculum (TMC) for liberal studies/integrated teacher education. All courses must be completed with a grade of C (2.0) or better and may not be taken for credit/no credit (Cr/NC). Additional preparation for the major:",
      "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The emphasis in education-generalist is open only to students who have completed the California Community College Associate in Arts in Elementary Teacher Education (AA-T) degree and completed the Transfer Model Curriculum (TMC) for liberal studies/integrated teacher education.&nbsp;All courses must be completed with a grade of C (2.0) or better and may not be taken for credit/no credit (Cr/NC). Additional preparation for the major:<span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span></span></p>"
    }
  ],
